BRANCHING POLICY (v0.9.5+):
===========================
All future versions MUST be created as new branches from the last stable version.
To create a new version:
  1. git checkout funnypilot-0.9.X  (current stable)
  2. git checkout -b funnypilot-0.9.Y  (new version)
  3. Make changes and commit
  4. git push funnypilot funnypilot-0.9.Y
  5. Update FUNNYPILOT_VERSION with new version number

